WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:04.940
As one encounter led to a double romance...

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.740
...three beating hearts...

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.140
...played gentle melodies.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:12.450
I, Kasuga Kyosuke, 15 years old...

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.030
...am living the best years of my youth!

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:30.400
That's the accelerator screamin',
as the tires are squealin'...

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:36.960
...takin' you along, a girl I hardly knew,
in my speedin' coupe.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:42.680
You slammed the door,
evadin' the shadows that followed...

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:49.420
...sayin' "Take me anywhere, Just go!"

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.320
An encounter is like a highway junction...

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:55.390
I've fallen in love with you - that I realized...

00:00:55.390 --> 00:01:01.430
...by the time the seaport was in sight...

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:04.530
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:13.310
Sayin' that you desire
tenderness over a caress...

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:16.640
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:25.650
...the way you avoided me, usin' that
naive look, wasn't so innocent.

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:28.960
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:37.730
Sayin' that you desire
a caress over loneliness...

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:41.170
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:51.500
...the way you looked into my eyes as
you turned back wasn't so innocent.

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:05.190
Hikaru?! A Sensational "C" Experience.

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:10.070
Today... I was supposed to go
out with Hikaru on a date...

00:02:10.070 --> 00:02:14.580
...but I never thought that
I'd run into Ayukawa...

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:17.880
...and, well... things happened...

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:19.720
It seems that...

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:25.020
...I was entranced by the thought
of being alone with Ayukawa...

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:29.960
...but that's no excuse for forgetting
about my date with Hikaru.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:30.620
By the time all was said and done...

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:32.320
Bulletin Board: "Kyosuke, you jerk!"

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:32.980
By the time all was said and done...

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:41.040
...I ended up catching a cold...

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:45.260
...and then I got a fever;
I couldn't sleep a wink.

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:49.900
Jingoro... water... water...

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:00.750
Fine! I'll just use my Power!

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:19.930
Doesn't work! I can't use my Power!
Boy, I must be REALLY sick!

00:03:35.990 --> 00:03:38.960
I wonder who that is?
Dad should be working tonight.

00:03:45.430 --> 00:03:47.950
H...Hikaru!

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.400
Sempai!
"Sempai:" "Senior," referring to someone
above you (in this case, in school).

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:55.600
I was just walking, and...
I don't know what came over me.

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:02.080
...before I knew it, I found myself here.

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:07.620
I'm sorry... the reason why...
I stood you up was... because...

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:08.990
...my dad, er...

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:11.950
You were helping out your father?

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:17.300
Right! That's it!

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:20.170
Oh, so that's what happened!

00:04:20.170 --> 00:04:21.300
I'm really sorry about that.

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:22.000
Not at all. I'm sorry I wrote such an
awful thing on the bulletin board!
I'm really sorry about that.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:25.260
Not at all. I'm sorry I wrote such an
awful thing on the bulletin board!

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:28.940
I can't believe that I lied...

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:41.320
Why, you...!

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:44.080
Excusez moi!
Why, you...!

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:44.160
Why, you...!

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:44.920
What the...?!

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:46.510
Hi, Hikaru!
What the...?!

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:49.100
Howdy!

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:50.920
Congratulations, Oniichan!

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:55.110
We were worried about you, Oniichan,
because you're a late-bloomer...

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:57.480
...but you've finally grown up enough
to be able to bring girls home!

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:58.530
Manami!

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:02.670
Well, then, relax and make
yourselves comfortable!

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:07.610
They can be so obnoxious sometimes!

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:12.160
But... now that she mentions it...

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:14.660
...this is the first time I've
had a girl in my room...

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:17.080
...and late at night, to boot!

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:21.890
Say, Sempai? Would you go out on
a date with me today, after school?

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:24.020
S...Sure...

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:29.140
There are things I'd like to talk about,
like our future...

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:33.000
You're right, like our future and...
What?! Our future?!

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:43.010
Your coffee is gonna get cold.
How many sugars do you take?

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:45.810
Oh... I'll do it!

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:53.760
C...Cookies or something
sure would've been nice!

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:56.840
That Manami... she's so inconsiderate!

00:05:56.840 --> 00:05:59.400
I love coffee all by itself.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:03.830
Gee, me too!

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:16.820
Being alone with her like this...

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:21.840
...I can't help noticing that
Hikaru is a girl after all.

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:44.710
But... in the end, nothing happened.

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:47.540
We listened to music
and stayed up 'til dawn.

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:13.740
That's all there was to it, but...

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:17.570
... who knew that it'd cause chaos at school?

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:24.220
Hey, listen to this... Kasumi said she...

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:27.330
...dreamed of sleeping in bed
with her boyfriend last night!

00:07:27.330 --> 00:07:28.520
Ugh! Naughty!

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:29.350
Risqué! Risqué!
Ugh! Naughty!

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:29.430
Ugh! Naughty!

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:34.000
Oh? My brother was with a girl
all last night, in bed!

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.640
What?!

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.570
Oh, c'mon, Kurumi, you're lying!

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:40.940
It's true! It was Hikaru, in the next homeroom.

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:43.000
She's rad!

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:47.370
Oh! I can picture her doing it!

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:48.310
Really!

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:51.080
I was wondering why she's
been so sweet lately...

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:54.040
That explains it, she's been doing it with a guy!

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:57.820
Ugh, how dirty... but, I'm jealous...

00:07:57.820 --> 00:07:59.880
Yeah, me too...

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:00.780
I wish it had happened to me!

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:03.310
No... No way!
I wish it had happened to me!

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:07.020
Kasuga, that dirty dog!

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:12.960
Hey, did you hear? Some freshman
named Hikaru slept with Kasuga!

00:08:13.730 --> 00:08:15.300
Oh! Speaking of which, I saw...

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:19.210
...Hikaru coming from the direction of
Kasuga's apartment this morning!

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:20.770
No way!

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:28.820
Why, you! You're cold, Kasuga!
We're supposed to be buddies!

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:31.390
You could've let me know about this earlier!

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:33.550
"Know about this?" What do you mean?

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:35.660
Why, you! Don't pretend you don't know!

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:35.720
"A" = Kissing. "B" = Petting. "C" = Sex. "D" = Pregnancy!

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:39.660
That freshman Hikaru... You "C'd" her!

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:39.720
"A" = Kissing. "B" = Petting. "C" = Sex. "D" = Pregnancy!

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:42.780
You don't look like much...
but, man, you're a STUD!

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:42.830
"A" = Kissing. "B" = Petting. "C" = Sex. "D" = Pregnancy!

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:46.660
And? And? What did you do to get
Hikaru to go to bed with you?!

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:50.540
You idiot! What the hell
are you talking about?!

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:53.510
Oh, c'mon! No need to deny it now!

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:55.850
You and Hikaru in bed... one night
together as man and woman....

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:57.540
Everyone in school is talking about it!

00:08:57.540 --> 00:09:01.820
Oh, come on... Why would I ever
do a thing like that with Hikaru?!

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:03.880
Pardon me...

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:08.960
I, for one, believe that Jr. High students
shouldn't be doing such things.

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:09.220
Now for some sausage...

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:10.410
Oh, shut up!
Now for some sausage...

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:10.490
Now for some sausage...

00:09:10.490 --> 00:09:13.300
So, how was it?! What does it feel like,
now that you're a man?

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:14.930
Look...

00:09:14.930 --> 00:09:16.490
Oh, my "Honorable Big Brother!"

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:17.430
"Honorable Big Brother?!"
Oh, my "Honorable Big Brother!"

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:17.500
Oh, my "Honorable Big Brother!"

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:21.090
I sure wanna do those kind of things
with Kurumi and Manami!

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.840
Will you knock it off?!

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:26.390
I didn't get to "C" with Hikaru,
I'm telling you!

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:31.720
Oh...

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:33.740
Shit...

00:09:46.260 --> 00:09:49.780
Really? He was helping his dad with his job?

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:52.430
Yes, that's what he said.

00:09:52.430 --> 00:09:56.240
The reason why he stood me up wasn't
because he didn't like me.

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:56.970
Hikaru...

00:09:56.970 --> 00:09:58.590
Y...Yes?
Hikaru...

00:09:58.590 --> 00:09:58.670
Hikaru...

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:03.600
Guys, you see... tend to lie when
they find it convenient to do so.

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:07.450
Do you believe what he told you?

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:09.310
Yep!

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:14.210
I don't think he's the kind
of person who can lie.

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:20.560
I mean... when he tried to give
me some sugar cubes...

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:24.800
...and ended up touching my hand...
He's so pure at heart!

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:27.800
That's why... I believe in my man.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:33.760
I understand. Then, hang in there, Hikaru.
I wish you the best.

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.680
Sure!

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:39.920
I'm so psyched up now...

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:45.000
...now that I've got a chance to talk
to you, Madoka! I'll do my best!

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:48.840
See ya!

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:53.520
"my man...?"

00:10:57.790 --> 00:11:01.540
Helping his dad?

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:04.570
What a lie...

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:19.520
Haven't you heard...?

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:22.120
There's this awful rumor going around about us!

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:24.320
Geez! It's so annoying, don't you think?

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:27.120
I'm not annoyed at all, really.

00:11:27.960 --> 00:11:30.630
'Cause... our relationship
is now something that...

00:11:30.630 --> 00:11:33.290
...the whole school approves of!

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:35.510
B...But...

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:39.020
...doesn't it make you mad when they
say totally untrue things about us?!

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:43.930
So you don't like me after all, Sempai...?

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:49.770
You don't like me after all...

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:53.940
H...Hold on!

00:11:55.050 --> 00:11:59.070
How could I not like
someone as cute as you?

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:00.990
Really?! Yippee!

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:04.780
H...Hikaru! That's not a good idea...

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:09.730
Darling! I knew it!
Darling, you're wonderful!

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:17.010
I give up...

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:19.030
Sempai...
I give up...

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:30.790
Ayukawa! It's all a big misunderstanding...

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:34.220
I... didn't get to "C" with Hikaru!

00:12:34.890 --> 00:12:37.620
Wait!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:14.270
Excuse me.

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:22.220
You thought of me THAT much?
I'm so happy!

00:13:22.220 --> 00:13:24.120
Wait... Hikaru...

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:26.980
Oh, say, er... could we get through?

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:34.130
I don't want you going inside.

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:36.090
Say what?
I don't want you going inside.

00:13:37.260 --> 00:13:39.270
Oh! Ayukawa!

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:41.610
Oh, I was just, er...

00:13:41.610 --> 00:13:44.740
Well, seeing the nurse over a tiny scratch
like this is going overboard!

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:45.870
Wh...What?!

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:47.770
Hey, try walking!
Wh...What?!

00:13:47.770 --> 00:13:48.610
What?!
Hey, try walking!

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:48.740
What?!

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:49.340
See? You can walk! Let's go!
What?!

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:50.880
See? You can walk! Let's go!

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:52.240
W...Wait!
See? You can walk! Let's go!

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:52.380
W...Wait!

00:13:52.380 --> 00:13:55.290
Oh, shit...

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:56.890
S...Sorry!

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:59.950
Darling!

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:04.850
I'm not lying! It's the truth!

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:08.930
No way!

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:11.330
But... they were on top
of the bed together...

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:15.740
Please! It's all because Kurumi
didn't explain it properly!

00:14:15.740 --> 00:14:20.260
My brother and Hikaru were just using
the bed as a chair, that's all.

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:22.970
Just as a chair?

00:14:22.970 --> 00:14:24.200
Yup. That's right.
Just as a chair?

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:26.150
That's so lame!
Oh, come on!

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:29.650
Well, you know... I had faith in your
brother from the beginning!

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:35.710
There's no way that he could
do something so depraved!

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:38.290
Hatta, you smart-ass!

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:40.160
Wh...Wh... Ow!
Hatta, you smart-ass!

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:40.240
Hatta, you smart-ass!

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:41.760
That hurt!

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:41.990
Why, you...
That hurt!

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:43.790
You think you're tough?!
Why, you...

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:51.140
Oniichan?

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:53.200
How are you feeling?

00:14:56.010 --> 00:14:58.750
You'll feel great if you drink this.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.450
What on earth is it?

00:15:00.450 --> 00:15:01.510
Egg-sake.
What on earth is it?

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:03.550
I don't want stuff like that!
Egg-sake.

00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:03.680
I don't want stuff like that!

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:05.080
You've got to drink it!

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:06.110
No way!
You've got to drink it!

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:08.450
Oh, c'mon!

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:22.400
Kurumi...

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.490
After all, we've got to help
you get well quick!

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:30.460
Oh, mama! Sake... Looks like
I'm gonna get plastered...

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:44.430
"Excuse me..."

00:15:44.430 --> 00:15:48.420
A...yu...ka...wa...

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:52.270
I'm gonna take a bath first!

00:15:52.270 --> 00:15:53.330
Sure!

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:35.100
Keep it quiet... Right?

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:41.030
9...

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:44.010
10...

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:55.150
Come on... answer...

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:08.350
19... 20!

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:10.080
Hello?

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:13.920
Hello?! Ayukawa?!
It's me! Kasuga Kyosuke!

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:15.350
What do you want?!

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:18.760
Er...er... I want you to just listen
to what I've got to say!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:21.260
About the rumor that's
going around the school...

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:23.870
...it's all just a huge misunderstanding!

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:26.200
I'm busy right now...

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:28.270
It's true that she came over to my house...

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:31.270
...but we were only
chatting and drinking coffee!

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:34.170
As for what happened at the nurse's room,
I was really out of it, and...

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:37.410
...when I ended up holding her,
you came in...

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:40.910
Why are you even bothering to tell me this?!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:43.940
I hate listening to men
and their excuses!

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:52.250
"Excuses..."

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:58.300
At that moment...

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:02.230
...I was feeling so dizzy because
of the fever and egg-sake...

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:06.230
...that I can't remember exactly what I said.

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:09.640
But, Ayukawa was right.

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:13.450
Calling her to deliver a lame excuse,
just to clear up some misunderstanding...

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:17.920
...was not really the kind of thing that
a man should've done, or so I felt.

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:21.240
What a loser I am! What a loser...

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:28.310
I might start disliking a man...
who'd resort to excuses.

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.860
Say...

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:42.680
Kasuga-Sempai, what are your
feelings towards Madoka?

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:45.540
Wh...Why do you ask, all of a sudden?!

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:48.110
'Cause, it seems as though you don't like her.

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:50.540
Th...That's not true!

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:54.280
I'm glad! 'Cause I think that Madoka
is such a wonderful person!

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:56.590
Whew, that scared me for a second.

00:18:56.590 --> 00:19:00.220
Who knows what this girl will say,
right out of the blue!

00:19:00.220 --> 00:19:02.190
Ushiko!

00:19:02.190 --> 00:19:03.490
Umao!

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:04.630
Ushiko!

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:08.360
Ushiko! Wherefore art thou, Ushiko?

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:11.360
Umao! And, wherefore art thou, Umao?!

00:19:12.430 --> 00:19:15.740
You seem to regard Ayukawa very highly.

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:18.800
It's almost as if she's my big sister.

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:21.210
Look at this.

00:19:21.210 --> 00:19:22.260
Hmm...?
Look at this.

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:22.340
Look at this.

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:27.070
This pendant is packed with
my memories of Madoka.

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:40.030
Yo, whatcha think, she ain't bad, eh?

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:42.960
Wanna try picking her up?

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:47.940
Everyone says Madoka is short-tempered
and gets upset easily...

00:19:47.940 --> 00:19:49.910
...but she's really nothing like that.

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:53.370
Like, one time... It was when
I was really little...

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:03.660
"Gimme back!"

00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:05.880
"Beat it!"

00:20:11.590 --> 00:20:14.060
"Give back Hikaru's pendant!"

00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:16.330
"How many times do I have to tell you?"

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:19.160
"My son didn't take it away from her!"

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:27.700
Say, forget this dumb flick! Wanna hang
out and do something much more fun?

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:32.640
I can take you to a really awesome place!

00:20:55.030 --> 00:20:58.710
In the end, Madoka's persistence
won out, and the boy gave up.

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:02.930
The next day, he returned the pendant!

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:07.290
She must be really strong at heart.

00:21:07.290 --> 00:21:11.440
Yo, girlfriend, stop lookin' mean like that!
Hang out with us!

00:21:11.440 --> 00:21:12.680
Get lost!

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:12.980
Huh?! Waddya say?!
Get lost!

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:15.650
Huh?! Waddya say?!

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:17.810
I can't see the movie very well...

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:21.150
...when your butt-ugly faces are in my way!

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:26.330
Wh...Why you...!

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:36.040
Bitch!

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:40.480
Hold it, you!

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:47.610
Sempai, would you go out
on a date with me again?

00:21:47.890 --> 00:21:49.360
Wh... Sure.

00:21:49.360 --> 00:21:51.890
YES!

00:21:53.320 --> 00:21:56.290
See you later! Bye-bye!

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:01.900
Hey, you!

00:22:01.900 --> 00:22:03.830
Stop right there!
Hey, you!

00:22:03.830 --> 00:22:05.930
We ain't through with you yet!
Stop right there!

00:22:07.740 --> 00:22:09.140
Ayu... kawa...

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:14.280
Why you!

00:22:32.360 --> 00:22:34.730
You've got some nerve, girl!

00:22:56.720 --> 00:22:58.120
Kasuga!

00:23:00.420 --> 00:23:01.160
Asshole!
Asshole!

00:23:01.160 --> 00:23:01.960
We ain't through with you yet!

00:23:01.960 --> 00:23:03.090
You dumb bitch!
We ain't through with you yet!

00:23:08.600 --> 00:23:11.710
That was a big earthquake!

00:23:11.710 --> 00:23:15.110
Seems like you don't have a fever.

00:23:15.110 --> 00:23:18.970
Ayukawa...

00:23:19.380 --> 00:23:25.260
Just then, I wanted to... tell her that
I had heard Hikaru's story...

00:23:25.260 --> 00:23:27.460
...but I decided not to.

00:23:27.460 --> 00:23:29.880
I don't know why exactly...

00:23:30.390 --> 00:23:36.830
...but, somehow... it seemed better
this way, not saying anything...

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:39.860
...not saying anything at all.

00:24:04.850 --> 00:24:12.470
I dream of casting a spell that
captures your heart...

00:24:12.470 --> 00:24:20.040
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:20.040 --> 00:24:35.390
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory.
I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:35.390 --> 00:24:48.000
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:48.000 --> 00:24:58.210
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:24:58.210 --> 00:25:05.220
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:25:05.220 --> 00:25:16.620
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:23.300 --> 00:25:24.610
Say, Hikaru?

00:25:24.610 --> 00:25:27.330
What's this "adult circumstance not to
be seen" that you're talking about?

00:25:27.900 --> 00:25:28.710
What?!

00:25:28.710 --> 00:25:31.580
A...Ayukawa was seen...
with a middle-aged man...

00:25:31.580 --> 00:25:35.040
...going into a h... h... hotel?!

00:25:35.540 --> 00:25:39.690
Next time: "A Secret for Two - A Problematic Part-Time Job"

00:25:39.690 --> 00:25:43.520
I... can't believe it!
